Hi,

I'm very pleased to announce the HP has successfully self-certified
twenty (20) IPP Everywhere Printer models!

Note:  PWG Logo Certification for IPP Everywhere Printers is FREE
to PWG members and is fully automated (run the tests, submit test
results to PWG self-certification server, get public announcement,
and receive PWG logo files).

Cheers,
- Ira (PWG Secretary, IPP WG Co-Chair)


